(7193617, 1106788, 16148, '<td valign="top">A very nice mundane image that works well for this challenge.  I can sense the speed of your vehicle by the foreground blur.  I picture you behind the wheel, music playing, looking down the highway, and not paying any attention to this scene.  But I know that''s not true.</td>', 'A very nice mundane image that works well for this challenge.  I can sense the speed of your vehicle by the foreground blur.  I picture you behind the wheel, music playing, looking down the highway, and not paying any attention to this scene.  But I know that''s not true.', '2014-03-24 21:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
