(7194713, 1106510, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the mystery of this shot- are you stopped, because the bus has its lights and arm out, and are those grape vines, concord grapes, or some northern vineyard located on a wine tour of a state not typically known for wine? or are they vines at all? could be a new orchard. <br/> <br/>fun to ponder, whatever the rural truth is.</td>', 'I love the mystery of this shot- are you stopped, because the bus has its lights and arm out, and are those grape vines, concord grapes, or some northern vineyard located on a wine tour of a state not typically known for wine? or are they vines at all? could be a new orchard.  fun to ponder, whatever the rural truth is.', '2014-03-27 09:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
