(7196565, 1106788, 68178, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by insteps:</b></div><hr/><i> A very nice mundane image that works well for this challenge.  I can sense the speed of your vehicle by the foreground blur.  I picture you behind the wheel, music playing, looking down the highway, and not paying any attention to this scene.  But I know that''s not true. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s actually petty close, but I always pay attention to the scenery ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by insteps: A very nice mundane image that works well for this challenge.  I can sense the speed of your vehicle by the foreground blur.  I picture you behind the wheel, music playing, looking down the highway, and not paying any attention to this scene.  But I know that''s not true.   It''s actually petty close, but I always pay attention to the scenery ;)', '2014-03-31 18:24:51.000000', NULL, 0),
